WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.868
A trove of new text messages

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:02.702
and emails

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:04.671
revealing how Fox executives, hosts

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:05.705
and staff

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:06.740
really felt

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.640
about former President

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.843
Donald Trump and the 2020 election lies

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.845
he and his associates were pushing.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:12.379
One host

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:13.780
writing that he hates Trump quote

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:14.981
passionately adding

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:16.883
There isn't really an upside to Trump.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.118
This all comes

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:19.252
as part of Dominion

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:20.053
voting systems

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:23.356
$1.6 billion lawsuit against Fox.

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:24.324
CNN's Paula

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:24.791
Reid pored

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.259
through the wave of new court filings

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:28.094
and the new insight they give us into

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.129
what individuals

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:33.033
who work at Fox were truly thinking

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.235
New documents reveal more evidence

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:36.770
that Fox News stars

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.138
and top executives

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:39.205
believed Trump

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:40.940
and his allies were lying

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.675
about the 2020 election

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.711
Voter fraud is something that is real.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.746
That just took place two weeks ago.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:47.781
But amid falling

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:48.982
ratings, the network

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:51.918
continued to promote Trump and his lies.

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:53.386
The outcome of our presidential

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:54.387
election was seized

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:55.455
from the hands of voters,

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:57.057
according to court documents.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:57.924
Host Tucker

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:00.960
Carlson texted a producer on January 4th.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.195
20, 21

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.731
just two days before the Capitol attack.

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:06.166
We very, very close

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:07.901
to being able to ignore Trump.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.770
Most nights I hate him passionately.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.039
I can't handle much more of this.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.908
Admitting what a disaster it's

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:16.910
been is too tough to digest.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:17.911
But come on,

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.046
there isn't really an upside to Trump.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:23.283
Those private remarks a total contrast

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.618
to Carlson's public support of Trump

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:26.753
that same night.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:27.420
What happened

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.356
was the people in charge rigged the game.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.058
Carlson's private messages

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:32.592
were released

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:33.560
as part of Dominion

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:34.494
Voting Systems,

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:37.664
$1.6 billion defamation lawsuit

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.299
against the right wing network.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:40.667
The trove of documents

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.168
turned over in Discovery

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.837
reveal that doubts extended

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.371
all the way to the top

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.841
on January 21st 2021,

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:49.576
the first full day of President

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.211
Joe Biden's administration.

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:52.112
Fox Chairman

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.012
Rupert Murdoch

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:56.015
conceded in an email to Fox News's CEO

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.016
Suzanne Scott

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:58.418
that some of Fox's top

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:00.120
talent went too far.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:03.056
Disturbing irregularities have been found

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:05.425
and must be investigated to the fullest.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.026
Then during his deposition,

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.128
Murdoch was asked,

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.562
Do you believe that Dominion

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:10.296
was engaged

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.131
in a massive

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.766
and coordinated effort to steal the 2020

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.101
presidential election?

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:16.936
Murdoch replied, No.

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:17.704
Fox now

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:20.240
saying Dominion is Cherry-Picking emails

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.741
and documents to release

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:23.243
Dominion has been caught red

00:02:23.243 --> 00:02:25.211
handed using more distortions

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.379
and misinformation

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:28.414
in their PR campaign to smear

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:29.282
Fox News

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:30.984
and trample on free speech

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.485
and freedom of the press.

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:34.921
But Dominion says the emails, text

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.389
and deposition testimony

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:37.657
speak for themselves.

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:38.892
The revelations, though,

00:02:38.892 --> 00:02:40.393
didn't come as a surprise

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:41.961
to at least one Republican.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:44.063
I'm not surprised that intelligent people

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.965
realize that what they were saying on

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:48.868
the air was untruthful, was lies.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:52.505
And I'm just disappointed that they would

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:54.407
sell their

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:56.509
their personal integrity so cheaply.

00:02:57.944 --> 00:02:59.612
We're expecting new evidence

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:01.080
to be released tonight.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.882
Some of the documents already coming in.

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.651
We've begun to review those.

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:05.251
Jake, as you know,

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:06.452
both sides of this case

00:03:06.452 --> 00:03:07.487
have already asked a judge

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:09.122
to resolve this in their favor

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:10.557
without going to trial.

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:11.558
There is, of course, also

00:03:11.558 --> 00:03:13.393
a small chance that they could settle.

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:14.160
But right now,

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.229
this case is scheduled to go to trial

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:17.664
next month in Delaware.

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:19.699
It's expected to last around five weeks.

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:21.367
All right, Paula Reid, thanks so much.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.135
With me to discuss,

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:23.937
CNN political commentator

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:25.038
Corey Sellers,

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:26.673
a former Democratic elected

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:28.374
official and former Trump White House

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:30.043
communications director Alyssa

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:30.643
Farah Griffin.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:31.511
Bakari.

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:33.046
Here are some of the quotes from Tucker

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.681
Carlson revealed in the filings.

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:35.882
Tucker said, quote, We're very close

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:36.849
to being able to ignore Trump.

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.551
Most nights I truly can't wait.

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:39.919
I hate him passionately.

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.654
I blew it up, blew up at former

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:42.488
White House official Peter

00:03:42.488 --> 00:03:43.623
Navarro today in frustration.

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:44.390
I actually like Peter,

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.259
but I can't handle much more of this.

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:47.160
That's the last four years.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:47.660
We're all pretending.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:48.661
We've got a lot to show for it

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:49.696
because admitting

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:50.630
what a disaster it's

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:51.798
been is too tough to digest.

00:03:51.798 --> 00:03:52.232
But come on,

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:54.133
there isn't really an upside to Trump.

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:54.734
Now, hold on

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:55.768
one second, Bakari,

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:57.503
