00:08:22.635 --> 00:08:25.738
We haven't seen all of it, but I can't

00:08:25.738 --> 00:08:27.273
imagine this actually

00:08:27.273 --> 00:08:29.175
going to a jury verdict.

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:31.577
But you look at this evidence

00:08:31.577 --> 00:08:32.345
as it comes out,

00:08:32.345 --> 00:08:34.714
you look at reaching that high bar.

00:08:34.714 --> 00:08:36.449
It's still a very high bar to reach.

00:08:36.449 --> 00:08:38.184
But these comments by Rupert Murdoch

00:08:38.184 --> 00:08:39.418
and I agree with Alyssa,

00:08:39.418 --> 00:08:41.087
this is the most

00:08:41.087 --> 00:08:43.022
damning piece of evidence that comes out.

00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:45.191
This is the CEO of this Fox

00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:46.425
News conglomerate

00:08:46.425 --> 00:08:48.294
knowing that the information

00:08:48.294 --> 00:08:50.396
that they are putting out is false

00:08:50.396 --> 00:08:51.797
and willingly

00:08:51.797 --> 00:08:53.599
just or acquiescing to it

00:08:53.599 --> 00:08:54.634
being disseminated.

00:08:54.634 --> 00:08:56.002
That is a huge problem

00:08:56.002 --> 00:08:57.537
for their lawyers to overcome.

00:08:57.537 --> 00:08:58.771
I can only see their lawyers

00:08:58.771 --> 00:08:59.205
saying, look,

00:08:59.205 --> 00:09:00.373
we need to get out of this some way.

00:09:00.373 --> 00:09:01.741
We need to find an off ramp.

00:09:01.741 --> 00:09:02.642
What does that number

00:09:02.642 --> 00:09:04.710
what does that settlement look like?

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.845
Let's have that conversation

00:09:05.845 --> 00:09:07.113
and let's see if it can be done.

00:09:07.113 --> 00:09:07.446
Yeah.

00:09:07.446 --> 00:09:08.414
Listen,
I want to get your reaction

00:09:08.414 --> 00:09:09.315
to the fact that

00:09:09.315 --> 00:09:11.384
while this story is breaking,

00:09:11.751 --> 00:09:13.386
at the same time,

00:09:13.386 --> 00:09:14.120
the speaker of the House,

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:17.123
Kevin McCarthy, gave Fox exclusive access

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.824
to more than 40000 hours

00:09:18.824 --> 00:09:20.259
of capital security footage

00:09:20.259 --> 00:09:22.428
of the January six attack.

00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:24.330
And obviously, though, it

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.531
has been used on Fox

00:09:25.531 --> 00:09:27.967
to try to paint the insurrection

00:09:28.801 --> 00:09:31.704
as largely peaceful, largely on violent

00:09:31.704 --> 00:09:33.973
with a bunch of sightseers.

00:09:34.006 --> 00:09:35.141
Take a listen to how Republicans

00:09:35.141 --> 00:09:36.375
are responding on the Hill

00:09:36.375 --> 00:09:39.145
to how Fox portrayed this

00:09:39.512 --> 00:09:41.113
It's a revisionist thing that I think

00:09:41.113 --> 00:09:42.748
is unfair to the American people.

00:09:42.748 --> 00:09:45.451
It wasn't a stroll through the Capitol.

00:09:45.451 --> 00:09:47.653
It was a attack on our capital.

00:09:47.653 --> 00:09:49.322
It was an outrageous act.

00:09:49.322 --> 00:09:50.556
A lot of people were injured.

00:09:50.556 --> 00:09:52.959
Our building was was severely damaged.

00:09:52.959 --> 00:09:54.060
And efforts

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:55.361
to try to pretend that it was something

00:09:55.361 --> 00:09:56.362
other than that

00:09:56.362 --> 00:09:58.631
are despicable and frankly dangerous.

00:10:00.066 --> 00:10:02.535
McCarthy had a huge hand in this.

00:10:02.568 --> 00:10:04.236
Why would he do that?

00:10:04.236 --> 00:10:06.072
Oh, it's just so irresponsible

00:10:06.072 --> 00:10:06.672
and reckless.

00:10:06.672 --> 00:10:07.473
But it's also the most

00:10:07.473 --> 00:10:08.507
predictable outcome

00:10:08.507 --> 00:10:09.241
so Tucker

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:09.942
Carlson got something

00:10:09.942 --> 00:10:12.044
like 40000 hours of footage

00:10:12.244 --> 00:10:13.312
and he decided to air

00:10:13.312 --> 00:10:15.181
just random bits to suggest,

00:10:15.181 --> 00:10:16.549
of course, that it was peaceful,

00:10:16.549 --> 00:10:17.683
not going, you know,

00:10:17.683 --> 00:10:18.150
not airing

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.018
the footage that shows

00:10:19.018 --> 00:10:19.819
people like my friend

00:10:19.819 --> 00:10:20.886
Officer Fanone

00:10:20.886 --> 00:10:21.621
being beaten

00:10:21.621 --> 00:10:22.288
and people saying

00:10:22.288 --> 00:10:23.823
use his weapon to kill him.

00:10:23.823 --> 00:10:25.725
But this this again, this was a deal

00:10:25.725 --> 00:10:27.193
that Kevin McCarthy had made

00:10:27.193 --> 00:10:27.693
when he was trying

00:10:27.693 --> 00:10:28.928
to get the speakership.

00:10:28.928 --> 00:10:31.230
And what I think it does is it just

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.298
it undermines

00:10:32.298 --> 00:10:34.400
everything in the moment

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.435
that this huge lawsuit is looming.

00:10:36.435 --> 00:10:37.169
Tucker Carlson's

00:10:37.169 --> 00:10:38.904
actually leaning into conspiracy.

00:10:38.904 --> 00:10:40.740
He's not she's not shying away from it.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.341
And I think it shows how untouchable

00:10:42.341 --> 00:10:43.676
he feels at a network

00:10:43.676 --> 00:10:45.144
that has just boosted conspiracies

00:10:45.144 --> 00:10:46.512
left and right. Yeah.

00:10:46.512 --> 00:10:46.879
By the way,

00:10:46.879 --> 00:10:47.947
we're on day two of Speaker

00:10:47.947 --> 00:10:49.081
McCarthy not getting back to me

00:10:49.081 --> 00:10:49.982
and my four questions

00:10:49.982 --> 00:10:50.950
about whether he agrees

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:53.219
with the conclusions on that FOX program.

00:10:53.252 --> 00:10:54.353
Melissa Fair, Griffin.

00:10:54.353 --> 00:10:55.755
Bakari Sellers, thanks so much.

